< Access-Control-Allow-Private-Network: true
< Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Length, Content-Type, Date, X-Upstream-Auth, X-Upstream-Content-Encoding, X-Upstream-Content-Length, X-Upstream-Final-URL, X-Upstream-Final-Url, X-Upstream-IP, X-Upstream-Ip, X-Upstream-Location, X-Upstream-Protocol, X-Upstream-Redirects, X-Upstream-Timing, X-Upstream-Truncated
